:: p18:AuthorToolsGallery:body.22
[source]
语言：切换请求复用 Runtime 的 Host pending 路径。
[translation]
Language: selection uses the Runtime Host pending path.

:: p18:AuthorToolsGallery:body.24
[source]

默认语言：{value_1}，当前生效：{value_2}。
[translation]

Default locale: {value_1}; active locale: {value_2}.

:: p18:AuthorToolsGallery:body.36
[source]

切换成功后立即按新语言重绘当前页面，不新增 Story 历史项。
[translation]

After selection, the current page is redrawn immediately without adding a Story history entry.

:: p5:Start:body.4
[source]

雨云停在海边。熟悉的街道，重新写成一段可以选择的生活。
[translation]

Welcome to a day in town. Rain clouds linger by the sea; familiar streets become a new set of choices.

:: p5:Start:body.7
[source]

在旅舍醒来，去街上谋生，或沿小路走进森林。
[translation]

Wake at the guesthouse, earn your keep in town, or follow the forest trail.

:: p12:TownSettings:body.1
[source]
保存的是这段旅程的状态、地点、随机序列和 Reaction 次数。
[translation]
Your save keeps story state, location, the random sequence, and Reaction counts.

:: p12:TownSettings:body.9
[source]

提示：
[translation]

Hints:

:: p12:TownSettings:body.18
[source]

英文包展示本页与部分手册条目的翻译；完整剧情目前使用中文。
[translation]

This sample language pack translates this page and selected handbook entries. The full story is currently in Chinese.
